            "cleanText": "© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM)  Role: A practice and set of tools for maintaining the security and compliance of cloud resources.  Focus: Infrastructure-centric security.  Key Functions: - Visibility and Monitoring: Provides continuous monitoring to detect security risks and compliance gaps. - Misconfiguration Detection: Identifies vulnerabilities resulting from improper cloud infrastructure settings. - Compliance: Ensures adherence to industry regulations and standards by monitoring configurations and preventing \"configuration drift\". - Risk Mitigation: Automates the process of identifying and remediating risks and vulnerabilities.",
