            "rawHtml": "<h3>© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Cloud Access Security Broker (CASB)  Role:</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>A security policy enforcement point located between cloud service consumers and providers.  Focus: User-centric security and data security.  Key Functions: Data Security: Enforces policies for data loss prevention (DLP), encryption, and access control. Threat Protection: Detects and prevents threats like malware, ransomware, and compromised users. User and Entity Behavior Analysis (UEBA): Monitors user activity for anomalies and suspicious behavior. Visibility and Compliance: Provides visibility into cloud usage and ensures compliance with enterprise policies. Cloud Data Security</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential Cloud Access Security Broker (CASB)  Role: A security policy enforcement point located between cloud service consumers and providers.  Focus: User-centric security and data security.  Key Functions: Data Security: Enforces policies for data loss prevention (DLP), encryption, and access control. Threat Protection: Detects and prevents threats like malware, ransomware, and compromised users. User and Entity Behavior Analysis (UEBA): Monitors user activity for anomalies and suspicious behavior. Visibility and Compliance: Provides visibility into cloud usage and ensures compliance with enterprise policies. Cloud Data Security",
