            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Why DevSecOps Matters Integrating security into DevOps processes is no longer</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>optional. DevSecOps Best Practices ensure organizations proactively address vulnerabilities and safeguard systems and customer data. This approach reduces risks and enhances trust, compliance, and overall business value. Here&#x27;s why:</p></div>",
