            "lead": "© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential The Key Goals & Principles Of DevSecOps",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">The Key Goals &amp; Principles Of DevSecOps</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>DevSecOps aim to create a seamless integration of security into the software development lifecycle, ensuring that security is proactive, efficient, and effective. For different organizations, it may look a little different but the key principles are as follows:</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential The Key Goals & Principles Of DevSecOps DevSecOps aim to create a seamless integration of security into the software development lifecycle, ensuring that security is proactive, efficient, and effective. For different organizations, it may look a little different but the key principles are as follows:",
