            "subtitle": "DevSecOps Principles, CALMS & Secure SDLC",
            "lead": "© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential  Lean IT - We must consider secure delivery and incorporate built-in security into our value stream, as security is esse",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\"> Lean IT - We must consider secure delivery and incorporate built-in security into our value stream, as security is essential to our business value.</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p> Measurement - This involves applying security scorecards and measuring risk. Having a backlog and working on the high-risk priority items first, and determine those by measuring risk.  Sharing - sharing those identified risks across the organization to ensure the safety of our entire enterprise, sharing resolutions and ways to prevent those issues. Most importantly, it&#x27;s about sharing potential problems and threats.</p></div>",
