            "rawHtml": "<h3>© 2020  Cisco and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.   Cisco Confidential</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Development Follow secure coding practices to ensure that the software is developed with security,</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>includes using static analysis tools to identify potential vulnerabilities, following secure coding standards, and conducting regular code reviews. Deployment In this phase secure deployment practices includes conducting a security assessment of the deployment environment, implementing appropriate controls, and following best practices for securing the software in production. Maintenance Regularly patching the software is conducted to fix vulnerabilities, monitoring the software for security issues, and conducting regular security reviews to ensure that the software remains secure over time.</p></div>",
